<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>About Us - Cendekia Muda</title>
    <link
      href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css"
      rel="stylesheet"
    />
    <style>
      body {
        background-color: #0b1120;
        color: #ffffff;
        font-family: "Segoe UI", Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        min-height: 100vh;
      }
      header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        padding: 20px 24px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #1f293d;
      }
      main {
        flex-grow: 1;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 24px;
      }
      .card {
        background-color: #131c31;
        border: 1px solid #1f293d;
        border-radius: 20px;
        padding: 32px;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 28rem;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
        text-align: center;
      }
      .icon-box {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        color: #fbcfe8;
        font-size: 36px;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 24px;
        font-weight: bold;
        color: #fce7f3;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #9ca3af;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
      }
      .footer-info {
        padding-top: 20px;
        border-top: 1px solid #1f293d;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #6b7280;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }
      .footer-info strong {
        color: #9ca3af;
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 4px;
      }
      footer {
        background-color: #070b14;
        padding: 20px;
        text-align: center;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #9ca3af;
        border-top: 1px solid #1f293d;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <span style="font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 2px">CENDEKIA MUDA</span>
      <a href="/" style="color: #9ca3af; text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px"
        ><i class="fa-solid fa-house"></i> Home</a
      >
    </header>

    <main>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-box">
          <i class="fa-solid fa-circle-info"></i>
        </div>

        <h1>About Us</h1>

        <p>
          Sekolah Islam Cendekia Muda berkomitmen memberikan layanan terbaik
          melalui sistem digital terintegrasi untuk mendukung kelancaran
          kegiatan operasional, pendidikan, serta fasilitas sekolah.
        </p>

        <div class="footer-info">
          <strong>Request Portal v1.0</strong>
          <p>
            Dikembangkan untuk mendukung efisiensi layanan IT dan General
            Affair.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>

    <footer>
      <p>
        <i class="fa-solid fa-phone" style="color: #fbcfe8"></i> (022) 710 2888
        &nbsp;|&nbsp;
        <i class="fa-solid fa-envelope" style="color: #fbcfe8"></i>
        info@cendekiamuda.sch.id
      </p>
      <p>© 2024 Cendekia Muda. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>
  </body>
</html>
